course: dictionary
lesson: 387
title: Apatosaurus and its name
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words come from a long time ago, and they tell a story. An apatosaurus was a huge plant-eating dinosaur with a very long neck and a long tail. It lived in North America about 150 million years ago. «In 1903 Brontosaurus was judged to be the same as Apatosaurus.» Judged means decided or thought after looking at the evidence.
explain: Read the words around a new word to find its meaning. The clues here are plant-eating, long neck and long tail. Those clues show you what kind of animal the apatosaurus was. Always check by putting your meaning into the sentence and seeing if it still makes sense.
explain: Names can change when scientists learn more. «A 2015 study said it was different enough to be its own kind again.» Study means a careful look at evidence, so the scientists found new facts. A dictionary can help when context is not enough.
fact: An apatosaurus was a huge plant-eating dinosaur.
fact: It had a very long neck and a long tail.
fact: It lived in North America about 150 million years ago.
fact: For a long time it was known as «brontosaurus», but scientists now treat Brontosaurus as a separate but close relative.
fact: «Judged» means decided or thought after looking at the evidence.
exercise: «In 1903 Brontosaurus was judged to be the same as Apatosaurus.» What does judged mean here? | *Decided or thought, after looking at the evidence | Measured for size | Forgot | Jumped over
exercise: What is an apatosaurus? | *A huge plant-eating dinosaur with a long neck and tail | A type of ancient fish | A small meat-eating bird | A rock found in a museum
exercise: «A 2015 study said it was different enough to be its own kind again.» Find and copy one word that means a careful look at evidence. | said | different | *study | kind
test: Scientists once put Brontosaurus in the same group as which dinosaur? | Tyrannosaurus | *Apatosaurus | Triceratops | Stegosaurus
test: About how long ago did the apatosaurus live? | *About 150 million years ago | About 150 thousand years ago | About 150 years ago | Only last century
exam: What does «plant-eating» tell you about the apatosaurus? | *It ate plants | It could fly over the sea | It lived in water only | It ate other dinosaurs
